        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Hi, everyone! Glad to meet you all. My name is Bob. I want to share with you one of my experiences during the summer holidays. It was about helping my parents prepare a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "surprise",
            "ref": "v-surprise"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " party."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Last Saturday was my younger sister Lucy’s eighth birthday. Early in the morning, Mum took Lucy to visit my grandparents. This way, Lucy wouldn’t know about the surprise we had planned for her. Dad and I stayed at home. We first cleaned up the house. Then, we decorated our living room with colourful balloons and flowers. The room looked beautiful and bright. At last, Dad placed a big cake on the table in the living room. And I put eight candles on the cake."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "We had sent "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "invitations",
            "ref": "v-invitation"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to some relatives and friends on WeChat. In the afternoon, all the guests arrived. When Lucy came home with Mum and my grandparents, she was surprised. My little sister was very happy to see all of these guests in our house!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In the evening, the party started. Mum "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "led",
            "ref": "v-lead"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " Lucy to her birthday cake, and I "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "lit",
            "ref": "v-light"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the candles on it. Everyone then began singing “Happy Birthday” to her. When the song was over, the birthday girl "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "blew out",
            "ref": "v-blow-out"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the candles. We then ate the cake, gave her presents and had a great time together. Lucy was "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "all smiles",
            "ref": "v-all-smiles"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "! I was also very happy to have successfully helped to prepare her birthday party!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
